Dalamud and FFXIVClientStructs
------------------------------
This plugin builds against Dalamud (AGPL-3.0) and FFXIVClientStructs (MIT).
Neither is redistributed here.

Matching Dalamud's own AGPL-3.0 is the simplest position: identical terms on
both sides leave no combination question to answer at all. AGPL's network
clause has no practical effect on a desktop game plugin, which interacts with
no one over a network, so it costs nothing to carry.
